  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed as a noun or with する as a suru verb. Common in formal and written contexts such as news, official documents, and business communication. Implies fixing something that was wrong or inaccurate.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {訂正|ていせい}する (to correct)\n- {訂正|ていせい}を{求|もと}める (to demand a correction)\n- {訂正|ていせい}を{加|くわ}える (to make a correction)\n- {訂正|ていせい}{申告|しんこく} (amended tax return)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {修正|しゅうせい}: modification — broader term for any change or adjustment, not limited to fixing errors\n- {校正|こうせい}: proofreading — specifically checking text for errors before publication",
